  "description": "Drop-in HttpClient wrapper for .NET 8-10 with Polly resilience, response\n\t\t\tcaching, OpenTelemetry, and batch execution orchestration. One-line setup eliminates\n\t\t\tboilerplate for retries, circuit breakers, correlation IDs, and structured logging.\n\t\t\tPerfect for microservices, APIs, and web scrapers. Includes authentication providers\n\t\t\t(Bearer, Basic, API Key), concurrent requests, fire-and-forget operations, streaming\n\t\t\tsupport, and environment x user x request batch runs with progress and statistics.\n\t\t\tSupports .NET 8 LTS (until Nov 2026), .NET 9, and .NET 10. For web crawling features,\n\t\t\tsee WebSpark.HttpClientUtility.Crawler package.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
