  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.5.1 - Dependency maintenance: bumped Microsoft.Extensions.* and ILLink.Tasks to 10.0.8,\n\t\t\tMicrosoft.SourceLink.GitHub to 10.0.300. Removed unused CsvHelper and Markdig packages from\n\t\t\tCrawler project. Removed unused xunit.abstractions from Testing project. No API changes.\n\t\t\t2.5.0 - Stability and maintenance release with batch execution orchestration hardening,\n\t\t\timproved test resilience for edge-case environments, and dependency/security patch rollups\n\t\t\tfrom recent update cycles. Non-breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.4.0 - Tooling and UX improvements across demo and docs: refreshed batch execution UI\n\t\t\tinteractions, dependency modernization across .NET/npm toolchains, and regenerated\n\t\t\tdocumentation output. No API breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.3.0 - Added Batch Execution Orchestration (opt-in via EnableBatchExecution) with\n\t\t\ttemplate substitution, combinatorial execution across environments/users/requests,\n\t\t\tconcurrency throttling, progress reporting, streaming result sinks, aggregated statistics,\n\t\t\tand deterministic response hashing. Added interactive BatchExecution demo flow and updated\n\t\t\tdocumentation for package and GitHub Pages. Minor feature release; no breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.2.1 - Critical Fixes: Fixed cache key collision causing data leakage between authenticated\n\t\t\trequests. Fixed race condition in BearerTokenAuthenticationProvider token refresh with thread-safe\n\t\t\timplementation. Fixed HttpClient instance sharing and resource leaks. Fixed retry policy to only\n\t\t\tretry transient errors. Added configuration validation. All 711 tests passing. Zero breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.2.0 - Quality & Tooling: Added Source Link debugging, symbol packages (.snupkg),\n\t\t\ttrimming/AOT readiness with RequiresUnreferencedCode/RequiresDynamicCode annotations,\n\t\t\tpackage baseline validation, explicit ILLink.Tasks 10.0.1 reference, zero-warning build\n\t\t\tpolicy. Demo app migrated to Vite/NPM with ESLint/Stylelint/Prettier. All 237 tests\n\t\t\tpassing (711 runs across net8.0, net9.0, net10.0). Zero breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.1.2 - Security patch: Fixed js-yaml prototype pollution (GHSA-mh29-5h37-fv8m,\n\t\t\tMODERATE) and glob command injection (GHSA-5j98-mcp5-4vw2, HIGH) in documentation build\n\t\t\tdependencies. All Dependabot alerts resolved. Zero breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.1.1 - GitHub Actions: Fixed package verification step. Zero breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.1.0 - Added .NET 10 multi-targeting support. All projects now target net8.0,\n\t\t\tnet9.0, and net10.0. Updated Microsoft.Extensions packages to 10.0.0. All 291 tests\n\t\t\tpassing on all three frameworks (873 test runs, 0 failures). Zero breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.0.0 - MAJOR: Package split into base + crawler. Base package now 163 KB with 10\n\t\t\tdependencies (down from 13). Zero breaking changes for core HTTP users. Web crawling\n\t\t\tmoved to separate WebSpark.HttpClientUtility.Crawler package. CurlCommandSaver now uses\n\t\t\tJSON Lines format. All 474 tests passing.",
